        "quote": "(a) Method of Service. Notice shall be served in one of the following manners:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.65.450 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "86d59366-80a1-5f1d-8b4f-ac3f3ec78845",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 287,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:1",
          "start": 79
        },
        "quote": "(1) Personal service; residence service. Delivering the notice to the owner or leaving the notice at the owner’s dwelling or usual place of abode with someone of suitable age and discretion who resides there.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.65.450 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "f03800bb-4b54-577b-8c4b-e5e56b47f83c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 627,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:2",
          "start": 288
        },
        "quote": "(2) Personal service; residence service unsuccessful. If personal or residence service cannot be made, service may be effected by (i) leaving a copy of the notice at the owner’s dwelling or usual place of abode; and (ii) mailing to the owner by first-class mail a notice that the copy has been left at the dwelling or usual place of abode.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.65.450 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "0ca022da-52e4-5714-9a07-4ae5e908fd10",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 731,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:3",
          "start": 628
        },
        "quote": "(3) Personal service; legal entity. If the owner is a legal entity, service may be effected as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
