          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:9",
          "start": 1588
        },
        "quote": "(6) In addition to the methods identified in this section, but not in lieu of, the Code Official may provide notice by other methods, including, but not limited to, door hangers, conspicuously posting notice on the property, personal notification, telephone or electronic communication, or first-class mail.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.450:block:9#text",
